{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42591","headline":"退宫妓 · 廖融","name":"退宫妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"神仙风格本难俦，曾从前皇翠辇游。\n红踯躅繁金殿暖，碧芙蓉笑水宫秋。\n宝筝钿剥阴尘覆，锦帐香消画烛幽。\n一旦色衰归故里，月明犹梦按梁州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"廖融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42591.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42591","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}